model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway.accountConnections {
    metadata {
      constraint "Account row actions show safe listed identity and local drafts while details load. Saving and deleting require the account read's permission and the authoritative host mutation; listed data never grants write authority. Untouched fields follow fresh metadata, typed fields survive transient read failures, retry and loss of write permission without permitting a write; read-only dialogs focus Close rather than a disabled-field hint. Denial or removal clears protected forms, and removing one saved sign-in preserves its siblings. Accounts, app Accounts and setup actions share this behavior."
    }
  }
}
